# data-net-server
Server-side data management infrastructure for the weil neuro-hub data

If you would like to contribute, please clone this repo and submit push requests.

## Install
The recommended way to use this code in your own projects is to use pip. Simply add the following line to your 
`requirements.txt` file:
```bash
common @ git+https://github.com/Weill-Neurohub-OPTiMaL/data-net-server.git@main
```
And the run `pip install -r requirements.txt`.
Any updates to the code will be pulled whenever you re-run the above or run `pip install --upgrade server`

If you would like to use a different branch or commit, simply swap the `@main` for `@<branch>` or `@<commit>`.


